{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2716b1f79ba89d96b9aaaf9b3843a5e62bf76aa2136cce6bd60ec85e37b8de84", "ja": "（今日の撮影で、杏奈はくノ一の頭領を\n演じることになっている。調子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（今天拍摄时，杏奈要扮演女忍者的首领。状态怎么样呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1001_p", "source_sha256": "25955a2085a265cbeb21b17b22f23b15dbf75cf5b5edf8ea8f2d19d918b60e67", "ja": "お疲れさま、杏奈。\nなかなか難しそうな役だけど、今日は頑張ろうな！", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈。\n这个角色似乎相当难演，不过今天一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "0c13850e59c6a778cafa012f6b1164a7a6f2e8b4dc348e98f6e537c823db9a9c", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん……。\nうん……杏奈、がんばり、ます……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生……\n嗯……杏奈，会加油……的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "2648b2a026916921bcda5a35ad64564e66e21b876a99e23df2bb04d29cdb9da3", "ja": "忍びって……かっこいい、から……。\n杏奈……いっぱい、研究……しました……。", "zh": "因为忍者……很帅气……\n杏奈……做了很多、研究……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ce00cc997764b78bac7f0de893b09229d1a3b6f9a44f7539df52b76ce2371dd4", "ja": "研究？", "zh": "研究？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "0f614246650bfe246910b497a10eca9a290f7e25edb83f268e76b02b6ff9c744", "ja": "ん……杏奈が、どんな忍びだったら……\nみんな、かっこいいって、思うのかなって……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈在想，要是成为那种忍者的话……\n大家会不会觉得很帅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2c24e316d5563ad7f41a06329dd6a27b7aa3a2b50bb79b0ead8c229188e2f860", "ja": "なるほど……\nそれで研究の成果は、どんな感じだ？", "zh": "原来如此……\n那么，研究成果怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "322516f23aaad170bc0fd1331b0a8312df41ffd5c4a1e6e395e5d4eda8e7531b", "ja": "みんなが、憧れる存在……。\nそれが、かっこいい……なのかなって……。", "zh": "让大家憧憬的存在……  \n我觉得，那就是所谓的帅气……吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "4bd71e2ce0af0ad8f8b8e5d46cd06feea913bbee52565760c7024c6e89002a3c", "ja": "だから、杏奈にしかできないことが、できたら……\nすごく……かっこいいと、思います……。", "zh": "所以，如果能做到只有杏奈才能做到的事……\n我觉得……一定会非常帅气……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ab8aadd1a56e06c0154f0e31d45967045932a0599b18567202dac11220a5762d", "ja": "杏奈にしかできない事、か……でも普段だって、\n杏奈にしかできない事をしてると思うけどな。", "zh": "只有杏奈才能做到的事吗……不过，我觉得杏奈平时也在做只有她才能做到的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "d927cda34a4fafbf50cb691fb3c1f91512ac600e9c41577fc93c9bf4e158b7bd", "ja": "ううん……それだけじゃ、足りない……です。\nそれに……杏奈の役は、忍びの頭領……。", "zh": "不是的……光是那样……还不够……而且……杏奈的角色，是忍者首领……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "06a40803bb56b96f2cce3e87013945c9eaa415ef76d649b5be67f33de1ff73cc", "ja": "リーダーは、責任……あるから……\n仲間……全滅しないように、気をつけないと……。", "zh": "当队长……是有责任的……\n必须小心……不能让伙伴们……全军覆没……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1012_p", "source_sha256": "20804a3d6d80d523666faecb8a21ad93b01d2a3ac60aa9c209c71a3f5bc108ef", "ja": "リーダーの責任感か……確かに、そのとおりだな。\nどうだ、やれそうか？", "zh": "是队长的责任感吗……确实如此。\n怎么样，能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "6f7173f23a8ee4e0b1ca7807c6a31a89c4e1d51b08eaecec843b1f8cfa31caf9", "ja": "うん……難しいけど……でも、\n杏奈が失敗したら、みんなが危ないから……。", "zh": "嗯……虽然很难……但是，\n杏奈要是失败了，大家就会有危险……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "bc93974a0c521b5b975a88e79c904dd95a531b7c20b658e59feb6da7709853e3", "ja": "だから……がんばる、ね……！", "zh": "所以……我会加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1015_p", "source_sha256": "69b0eba887052f6b8914dd109671ef9b9e495eb5d7b6145e9d02443afb9ec860", "ja": "よし、その意気だ！\nそろそろ時間だな。着替えに行ってくるといい。", "zh": "好，就是这个干劲！\n差不多到时间了。去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "9e781f710ca6ac3f7bb6561e3c6f71807f484355ea100fe68b1a605a90ffdfc4", "ja": "{$P$}さん……杏奈、\nかっこよくできるかどうか……見てて、ね……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……杏奈，\n能不能帅气地完成……要看好了哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1dffc7fb64dd42852fbc85c6956503618e75f8ea1ebb18fe6c1185a2b1fe8a2d", "ja": "ああ！　ステージに立つ時と同じぐらい、\nかっこいい忍びの杏奈を期待してるよ！", "zh": "啊！我期待着你像站上舞台时一样，展现出帅气的忍者杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0193_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1ba5320d78cdf9412c5b543471e99505eb55ae0faa4fd46491603ad3e46749fc", "ja": "（その後、杏奈は忍びとして、しっかりと凛々しい\n演技を見せてくれた。やったな、杏奈！）", "zh": "（之后，杏奈作为忍者，给我们展现了十分英姿飒爽的演技。干得漂亮，杏奈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
